WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:04,270
My father is not young anymore

2
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:06,890
Worry about things in the court.

3
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:08,290
The body also needs to be tight

4
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,870
If Wei Teng commits a crime, he must ask an imperial physician.

5
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:12,170
Don't hold on

6
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,630
I know it well

7
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,440
This time in my last life

8
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:22,010
Lu Yunzheng hasn't gotten in touch with the prince yet

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,000
Since the Lu family is wholeheartedly looking forward to getting the prince,

10
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,720
Then I am today

11
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,720
Then he personally pushed Lu Yunzheng to the front of the prince.

12
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,540
The fact that he broke his wish

13
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,240
I'll have to wait and see

14
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,740
What will happen in the end?

15
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,460
Never

16
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,160
Worse than in the previous life

17
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:48,010
He left a light specially for me

18
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,210
He eats like this

19
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:53,070
If I continue to plot against him and push him away
